# Everything in this repo is LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Why it is pinned rather than left to each clone's core.autocrlf: several
# tests hash or execute checked-out files, and a CRLF checkout makes them wrong
# in ways that have nothing to do with the code. deploy/vision/udev's rule file
# is pinned by sha256; the deploy shell scripts run under `sh -n` and a
# shebang ending \r is no shebang at all. This repo's own content is Linux-only
# either way — udev rules, systemd units, POSIX shell — so normalising to LF
# states the truth instead of leaving it to the operator's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
